{
  "slug": "noibu",
  "name": "Noibu",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Built for ecommerce, the Noibu plugin bridges the gap between customer experience and revenue by connecting Claude directly to your store's session, error, and conversion data through Noibu — and to the marketing, support, and commerce platforms that put insight into motion. Go beyond analysis: surface what's costing you revenue, take action across your stack, build workflows to automate work end-to-end.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `build-business-context` (Builds a rich business-context Markdown file (a CLAUDE.md / context.md) so Noibu skills and Claude stop hallucinating and…), `checkout-analysis` (Analyze checkout performance and health using Noibu data), `product-analysis` (Analyze product and collection performance using Noibu data), `querying-noibu-data` (Required reference for calling `noibu_*` tools — field and measure semantics, query constraints (the `orderBy` requirement, row caps,…), `segment-analysis` (Analyze segment and traffic performance using Noibu data), `store-pulse` (An instant, at-a-glance read on your store's health from the last 24 hours — with the option to…), `tech-diagnosis` (Diagnose technical issues and Core Web Vital performance problems using Noibu data, and recommend a fix)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install noibu@claude-plugins-official` from `Noibu/ai-plugin` (`src`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
